# Plan: Persist ActionBar Settings to Database

## Goal
Store ActionBar button visibility preferences in the database so they sync across devices/logins.

## Approach
Add `actionbar` column to User model storing an array of enabled button IDs (e.g., `["pomodoro", "break"]`). Empty array = all hidden (default).

