## Behavior

| Scenario | Source |
|----------|--------|
| New user | Empty array = all buttons hidden |
| Logged in user | Load from `user.actionbar` |
| Logged out / offline | Fall back to localStorage |
| Toggle button | Save to backend + update localStorage cache |
